---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Printable Generator Maintenance Log" description="Print a blank generator service log for model, serial number, manual revision, operating hours, service work and next due dates."><article class="editorial-container publication-section maintenance-log"><h1>Generator maintenance log</h1><p>Use the exact unit’s manual and qualified service provider. This record does not replace required service.</p><button type="button" id="print-log" class="button no-print">Print / Save as PDF</button><dl class="log-identity">{['Generator model / serial','ATS model','Fuel','Manual / revision','Service provider / contact','Exercise schedule from manual','Next inspection'].map(label=><div><dt>{label}</dt><dd>________________________________________________</dd></div>)}</dl><table><caption>Record completed work and the next time / hour interval, whichever applies first.</caption><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Run hours</th><th>Work, parts / oil used, alarms</th><th>Performed by</th><th>Next due (date / hours)</th></tr></thead><tbody>{Array.from({length:12},()=> <tr><td> </td><td> </td><td> </td><td> </td><td> </td></tr>)}</tbody></table><p>Retain invoices and warranty-related service evidence. <a href="/maintenance/model-service-schedules/">Selected manual-based schedules</a>.</p></article></BaseLayout>
<script>document.querySelector('#print-log')?.addEventListener('click',()=>window.print());</script>
<style>.log-identity{margin:2rem 0}.log-identity div{margin:1rem 0;overflow:hidden}.log-identity dt{font-weight:600}.log-identity dd{max-width:100%;overflow:hidden}.maintenance-log table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.8rem;table-layout:fixed}.maintenance-log th,.maintenance-log td{border:1px solid #777;padding:.5rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.maintenance-log td{height:3.5rem}.maintenance-log th:nth-child(3){width:35%}@media print{.maintenance-log{width:100%;padding:0}.maintenance-log td{height:2.5rem}h1{font-size:24px}}</style>
